<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-TENERIFE'S VIVAR DORADO SENT OFF IN UEFA CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TENERIFE'S VIVAR DORADO SENT OFF IN UEFA CUP.</headline>
<dateline>TENERIFE, Spain 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tenerife's Angel Vivar Dorado was sent off for a challenge in the 55th minute of his side's UEFA Cup semifinal first leg tie against Schalke on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Tenerife (Spain) led Schalke (Germany) 1-0</p>
<p>Scorer: Felipe Minambres, penalty 5</p>
